          "text": "To purchase a used car at a total price of 13,000 dollars, a onetime down payment is required, and\nthen fixed monthly payments are made for the remaining amount owed for the car. The equation\n13 , $000=2$ , $600+260 t$ represents this situation, where $t$ is the number of fixed monthly\npayments that are made. Which of the following is the best interpretation of 260 in this context?"
